    {
      "source": "Invoked after population of normal bean properties but before an init callback such\nas <a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>\nor a custom init-method. Invoked after <a href=\"../ResourceLoaderAware.html#setResourceLoader(org.springframework.core.io.ResourceLoader)\"><code>ResourceLoaderAware.setResourceLoader(ResourceLoader)</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../ApplicationEventPublisherAware.html#setApplicationEventPublisher(org.springframework.context.ApplicationEventPublisher)\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisherAware.setApplicationEventPublisher(ApplicationEventPublisher)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../MessageSourceAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceAware</code></a>, if applicable.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后、但在初始化回调（例如 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>）或自定义 init-method 之前调用。在 <a href=\"../ResourceLoaderAware.html#setResourceLoader(org.springframework.core.io.ResourceLoader)\"><code>ResourceLoaderAware.setResourceLoader(ResourceLoader)</code></a>、<a href=\"../ApplicationEventPublisherAware.html#setApplicationEventPublisher(org.springframework.context.ApplicationEventPublisher)\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisherAware.setApplicationEventPublisher(ApplicationEventPublisher)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../MessageSourceAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSourceAware</code></a>（如果适用）之后调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers <a href=\"EventListener.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListener</code></a> methods as individual <a href=\"../ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a> instances.\nImplements <a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a> (as of 5.1) primarily for early retrieval,\navoiding AOP checks for this processor bean and its <a href=\"EventListenerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListenerFactory</code></a> delegates.",
      "translation": "将 `<a href=\"EventListener.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListener</code></a>` 方法注册为独立的 `<a href=\"../ApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationListener</code></a>` 实例。\n自 5.1 版本起，实现 `<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a>` 主要用于早期获取，从而避免对此处理器 bean 及其 `<a href=\"EventListenerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>EventListenerFactory</code></a>` 委托进行 AOP 检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\">ApplicationContextAware</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\">ApplicationContextAware</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\">setApplicationContext</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">ApplicationContextAware</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\">setApplicationContext</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../ApplicationContextAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">ApplicationContextAware</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Stephane Nicoll, Juergen Hoeller, Sebastien Deleuze",
      "translation": "Stephane Nicoll, Juergen Hoeller, Sebastien Deleuze",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>NOTE:</b> This callback won't be triggered for singleton beans\nlazily initialized on demand after <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> bootstrap,\nand not for any other bean scope either. Carefully use it for beans\nwith the intended bootstrap semantics only.",
      "translation": "<b>注意：</b>此回调不会为在 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 引导后按需懒式初始化的单例 Bean 触发，也不会为任何其他 Bean 作用域触发。请仅针对具有预期引导语义的 Bean 谨慎使用它。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\">SmartInitializingSingleton</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\">SmartInitializingSingleton</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked right at the end of the singleton pre-instantiation phase,\nwith a guarantee that all regular singleton beans have been created\nalready.",
      "translation": "在单例预实例化阶段的最末尾被调用，此时可以保证所有常规单例 Bean 已经创建完毕。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modify the application context's internal bean factory after its standard\ninitialization.",
      "translation": "在标准初始化之后修改应用程序上下文的内部 BeanFactory。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the ApplicationContext that this object runs in.",
      "translation": "设置此对象运行的 ApplicationContext。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modify the application context's internal bean factory after its standard\ninitialization. All bean definitions will have been loaded, but no beans\nwill have been instantiated yet. This allows for overriding or adding\nproperties even to eager-initializing beans.",
      "translation": "在标准初始化之后修改应用程序上下文内部的 Bean 工厂。此时所有 Bean 定义都已被加载，但尚未实例化任何 Bean。这允许您甚至对急切初始化的 Bean 进行属性覆盖或添加。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\">afterSingletonsInstantiated</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">SmartInitializingSingleton</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html#afterSingletonsInstantiated()\">afterSingletonsInstantiated</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/SmartInitializingSingleton.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">SmartInitializingSingleton</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
